exports[`deploy --remote > streams the build log, then prints the draft URL and how to deploy it to production 1`] = `
"⬥ Building 7046334 on Netlify (↗ View deploy logs https://app.netlify.com/projects/test-site/deploys/deploy_id)

│ Installing dependencies
│ Build script success

🚀 Deploy complete
